{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the Land of Skye.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s nothing like waking up in a strange new world with no memory of who you are\u2026\u00a0 Discover the secrets of Skye, a mysterious world of islands in the clouds.\u00a0 Taking inspiration from <i>Stardew Valley </i>and <i>Myst,</i>\u00a0explore, farm, meet mages in other realms, and solve the mysteries of the Garden of Skye in this relaxing game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061790/extras/8b126927b14ea04d03718d8510597006.avif?t=1774439250\" width=405 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore </strong>a mystical land, and uncover the secrets hidden within.\u00a0 Discover ancient ruins, solve the riddles within, and unlock power beyond your wildest dreams as you search for the clues about this mysterious land.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dozen islands to unlock and explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets and riddles to uncover the mystery of these forgotten, sealed lands</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061790/extras/c7c8a714551112269fafe0dede81dc86.avif?t=1774439250\" width=400 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Befriend</strong> the Mages who came to this land before you, guide\u00a0them through their troubles, and deepen your bonds as they guide you on your own quest for answers and freedom.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 mages with stories to discover and take part in</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gifts and assistance as you grow closer and help them with their goal</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061790/extras/513d933202b43139448b3202aa210047.avif?t=1774439250\" width=500 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farm</strong> resources and use your magic to simplify the process. \u00a0With the help of your fellow mages you'll find thriving in this world isn't as hard as it may first seem as your mastery of magic improves.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 30 mystical crops growing strange new materials</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mystic spells to make your life easier every step of the way</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4061790?t=1774439250","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4061790?t=1774439250","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061790/ec073783d299784a4bdcb96a76255c989caa7e24/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774439250","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061790/ec073783d299784a4bdcb96a76255c989caa7e24/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774439250","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4073810,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the Land of Skye.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s nothing like waking up in a strange new world with no memory of who you are\u2026\u00a0 Discover the secrets of Skye, a mysterious world of islands in the clouds.\u00a0 Taking inspiration from <i>Stardew Valley </i>and <i>Myst,</i>\u00a0explore, farm, meet mages in other realms, and solve the mysteries of the Garden of Skye in this relaxing game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061790/extras/8b126927b14ea04d03718d8510597006.avif?t=1774439250\" width=405 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore </strong>a mystical land, and uncover the secrets hidden within.\u00a0 Discover ancient ruins, solve the riddles within, and unlock power beyond your wildest dreams as you search for the clues about this mysterious land.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dozen islands to unlock and explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets and riddles to uncover the mystery of these forgotten, sealed lands</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061790/extras/c7c8a714551112269fafe0dede81dc86.avif?t=1774439250\" width=400 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Befriend</strong> the Mages who came to this land before you, guide\u00a0them through their troubles, and deepen your bonds as they guide you on your own quest for answers and freedom.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 mages with stories to discover and take part in</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gifts and assistance as you grow closer and help them with their goal</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061790/extras/513d933202b43139448b3202aa210047.avif?t=1774439250\" width=500 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farm</strong> resources and use your magic to simp